                        "$$type": "heroSection",
                        "heading": "\"Come Home to Clean — Not More Chores. Let Us Handle the Mess, So You Can Rest.\"",
                        "body": "At Willow Rain Company, we take the stress out of your day by handling the cleaning, hauling, and landscaping — so you don’t have to.\n\nServing **St. Charles and nearby areas**, our team is trained, reliable, and ready to tackle everything from deep house cleaning to junk removal and yard care. Whether it’s a one-time job or routine service, we show up on time and do it right.\n\n✅ **House Cleaning** – Sparkling results with our Detail-Clean Rotation System.\n\n✅ **Hauling** – Fast, affordable removal of clutter, junk, or yard waste.\n\n✅ **Landscaping** – Mowing, edging, mulching & seasonal cleanups.\n\n\n\n",
